message:
In `parse_events`, when `drawing_scale` is non-zero:
```c
q = p;
if (*p == '{')
    q++;
while ((*q != '{') && (*q != 0))
    q++;
drawing_text.str = p;
drawing_text.len = q - p;
```

If `*p` is non-zero (which it is, since we're in the `while (*p)` loop), then `drawing_text.len >= 1`. So `drawing_text.len` is always >= 1 in this path.

